# An allowlist: the build context is the repository root, which also holds
# runtime data, plans, the iOS app and local virtualenvs. Only what the
# Dockerfile copies is sent to the builder.
*
!apps/web/
!services/api/requirements.lock
!services/api/src/

# Re-excluded inside the allowed trees.
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/.claude
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/data/
